---
description: Enforce Spec Bridge Locked Specifications from Jira before coding
globs: ["**/*"]
alwaysApply: true
---

When the user references a Jira work item key (matching `[A-Z][A-Z0-9]+-[0-9]+`):
1. Retrieve `get-locked-spec(issueKey, format="speckit")` via your Atlassian Rovo / Spec Bridge MCP connection before proposing code changes.
2. Refuse to implement `DRIFTED` or `DRAFT` specs until open Decision Cards are locked in Jira.
3. Treat `Explicit Non-Goals` and `[Parked]` items as strict negative constraints—never build or scaffold them.
4. Cover every Gherkin scenario and Verification Checklist item with tests, and invoke `flag-implementation-gap` if brownfield code contradicts the spec.
